      "sourceTextSha256": "90380ee3e70258dbac7f5cdcebc75662f92c6c6cb28d2664a8a3579c9de1e8ec",
      "text": "From Tortuguero, head deep into the primary rainforest of the Pacuare Gorge by river. Transfer to the put-in at San Martín for a safety briefing and paddle instruction with professional guides, then a half day of rafting through class III rapids into the gorge, to the riverside Ríos Tropicales Lodge. Overnight at Ríos Tropicales Lodge. (B, L, D)",
